# Normalize all text files to LF line endings — in the repo and on checkout —
# regardless of the contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Deno fmt expects LF,
# and CRLF checkouts (the Windows autocrlf=true default) made
# `deno fmt --check` fail on every file. This attribute is authoritative; it
# overrides core.autocrlf for this repository.

* text=auto eol=lf
